  "title": "Iron Wall",
  "briefing": "On the Ashfall Plains our Reclamation Furnace is melting the wrecks of the old war into armour, and the Lattice has set up a siege camp to stop it. Hold the Furnace, just south-east of your base, for twelve minutes. Its heavy gun is the wall; you are the iron. The Lattice will come fast and from the air, so build AA. Then reinforcements arrive and you break the siege.",
