  "messages": [
    "The Furnace is gone. Cold iron.",
    "Twelve minutes. Keep the Furnace burning.",
    "The Lattice flies. AA Turrets and Flak Vehicles before the first aircraft show up.",
    "Striders from the north.",
    "Fast raid from the west.",
    "A Lattice gunship is scouting us. Bombers will follow. Build AA.",
    "Artillery with the northern column. It outranges your turrets.",
    "Bombers heading for the Furnace!",
    "Big push from the west.",
    "Gunships with a ground column.",
    "Two fronts at once.",
    "Everything they have. Hold!",
    "Six minutes left.",
    "Reinforcements on the field: six Anvils and two Artillery. Now break their siege camp on the north-west mesa.",
    "They're throwing everything left at the Furnace.",
    "Siege broken. The Furnace burns on, and the plains are ours."
  ],
